              "0000020Q": "Proportion of persons aged 20–25 years, percent",
              "0000020R": "Proportion of persons aged 20–64 years, percent"
            },
            "note": {
              "0000020O": [
                "The numerator consists of the number of persons registered in various forms of education during the autumn term. The denominator consists of the population. Aged 20–64 years. \r\n  \r\nSource: [Register on Participation in Education](https://www.scb.se/uf0507-EN)"
              ],
              "0000020P": [
                "The numerator consists of the number of persons aged 16–19 years who are neither gainfully employed nor are registered in any form of education during the autumn term. The denominator consists of the population. Aged 16–19 years. \r\n  \r\nSource: [Labour statistics based on administrative sources}(https://www.scb.se/am0207-EN) \r\n  \r\nSource: [Register on Participation in Education](https://www.scb.se/uf0507-EN)"
              ],
              "0000020Q": [
                "The numerator consists of the number of persons aged 20–25 years who are neither gainfully employed nor are registered in any form of education during the autumn term. The denominator consists of the population. Aged 20–25 years. \r\n  \r\nSource: [Labour statistics based on administrative sources}(https://www.scb.se/am0207-EN) \r\n  \r\nSource: [Register on Participation in Education](https://www.scb.se/uf0507-EN)"
              ],
              "0000020R": [
                "The numerator consists of the number of persons aged 20–64 years who are neither gainfully employed nor are registered in any form of education during the autumn term. The denominator consists of the population. Aged 20–64 years. \r\n  \r\nSource: [Labour statistics based on administrative sources}(https://www.scb.se/am0207-EN) \r\n  \r\nSource: [Register on Participation in Education](https://www.scb.se/uf0507-EN)"
